  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in any wall of the flat hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the house hereby permitted is first occupied, acoustic insulation shall be installed to ensure that the maximum externally generated noise level experienced within the dwelling shall not exceed; in living rooms: LAeq (16 hour) of 40 dB and at night LAeq (8 hour) of 35 dB; and in bedrooms an LAF max of 45 dB.",
    "Condition : 5 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the front elevation shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 6 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced a scheme indicating the provision to be made for disabled people to gain access to teh ground floor flat shall have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The agreed scheme shall be implemented before the development hereby permitted is brought into use."
  ],
